WEBVTT

00:06:29.844 --> 00:06:31.846
provided by regular people.

00:06:32.263 --> 00:06:36.142
I’m talking about community,
and I’m talking about systems change

00:06:36.142 --> 00:06:37.893
at the same time.

00:06:38.686 --> 00:06:41.689
First, we train everybody
in public schools,

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:44.692
public hospitals, clinics
and police precincts

00:06:44.733 --> 00:06:46.777
on trauma, education and self care

00:06:46.777 --> 00:06:49.113
so they can better take care of themselves

00:06:49.155 --> 00:06:52.491
and also those that they serve
understand trauma and manage it.

00:06:53.159 --> 00:06:55.703
Then we train a subset
as interventionists

00:06:55.703 --> 00:06:57.371
so they can deal with emergencies,

00:06:57.413 --> 00:06:59.957
providing crisis intervention
and ongoing support.